. Fitting a straight-line to the data gives a regression model of</p>

<p class="lt-chem-157674">\[\frac{A_{\operatorname{mix}}}{A_{S X}}=0.636+2.01 \times \frac{A_{S Y}}{A_{S X}} \nonumber\]</p>

