<p class="lt-chem-157674">\[\frac{C_{X}}{C_{S X}}=\frac{\left[\mathrm{Co}^{2+}\right]}{0.0750 \mathrm{M}}=0.636 \nonumber\]</p>

<p class="lt-chem-157674">or [Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup>] = 0.048 M; using the slope the concentration of Cr<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup> is</p>

<p class="lt-chem-157674">\[\frac{C_{Y}}{C_{S Y}}=\frac{\left[\mathrm{Cr}^{3+}\right]}{0.0250 \mathrm{M}}=2.01 \nonumber\]</p>

<p class="lt-chem-157674">or [Cr<sup>3</sup><sup>+</sup>] = 0.050 M.</p>
