    <p class="lt-chem-157674">The figure below shows a continuous variations plot for the data in this exercise. Although the individual data points show substantial curvature&mdash;enough curvature that there is little point in trying to draw linear branches for excess metal and excess ligand&mdash;the maximum absorbance clearly occurs at <em>X</em><sub>L</sub> &asymp; 0.5. The complex&rsquo;s stoichiometry, therefore, is Fe(SCN)<sup>2+</sup>.</p>

